        },
        "question_hXhQ8i": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does creatine have any negative side effects?",
            "content": "<p>There are few negative side effects of creatine. Some people report stomach discomfort or water retention during the initial supplementation phase. There is little evidence to support that creatine causes hair loss, increased fat, or kidney damage.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
