          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why is your product more expensive than other creatine products?",
            "content": "<p>Creatine is one of the most affordable fitness supplements on the market. Our gummy is more expensive than most other alternatives due the convenient, delicious gummy form factor and the quality of our ingredients.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
