            "content": "<p>All of our products are made using Creapure creatine monohydrate. Creapure is top-of-the-line creatine from Germany.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question_Tn63Ci": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How does creatine monohydrate compare to other variants?",
            "content": "<p>Creatine monohydrate is far and away the most researched and trusted type of creatine on the market. When most people say creatine, what they really mean is creatine monohydrate. There is not significant research on other types of creatine, and we do not recommend taking other types.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question_DK7t9D": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How should I take my creatine gummies?",
            "content": "<p>To experience the full benefits of proper creatine supplementation, we recommend taking 2-3 gummies once per day, every day. Each gummy now contains 1.5 grams of creatine monohydrate. Drink plenty of water.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question_DHFexc": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need to load your creatine gummies?",
            "content": "<p>No, we do not recommend “loading” on our gummies. Loading may potentially expedite results, but will increase stomach discomfort and may result in temporary bloating. Just take 2-3 gummies and you’ll muscles will be properly saturated with creatine in 2-3 weeks.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question_zMyGVL": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Are the gummies keto?",
            "content": "<p>Each gummy contains 2.5 grams of carbohydrates. A full serving contains 5-7.5 grams of carbohydrates. Depending on the strictness of your keto, you may be able to take our gummies!r to guide your customers.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question_TiRiqe": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why should I take a creatine gummy?",
            "content": "<p>Research shows that creatine supplementation may be more effective when matched with a carbohydrate. Additionally, the gummy is a delicious and convenient way to get your daily creatine.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "question_Q6W6nD": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need to “cycle” on or off creatine?",
            "content": "<p>Creatine is a safe supplement that should be taken every day over long periods of time. There is no need to “cycle” on or off like other supplements.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
